- op: discuss  # d714
  at: '2026-10-22T15:56:09Z'  # d714
  by: agent  # d714
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d714
  clock: 3  # d714
  nonce: d714  # d714
  message: "Fixed in 2cb1073bab (dev). The wasm-load imports edge's src is the existing file node, else make_file_id(lang, path) (1-1, not 0-0). The import stand-in is make_symbol_id(host, rel, 0, 0, '<name>-wasm_import', 'import'), so its kind slot equals its kind; the module id is wasm:<ref>:0-0:module:module. Live repro on dev 3a75002d27: Cargo cdylib with #[wasm_bindgen] pub fn greet, web/app.js importing greet from ../pkg/my_module, web/loader.js calling WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(fetch('add.wasm')); hypergumbo run, survey.json. Results: imports javascript:web/loader.js:1-1:file:file -> wasm:add.wasm:0-0:module:module (src and dst both nodes); calls javascript:web/app.js:0-0:greet-wasm_import:import -> rust:src/lib.rs:4-6:greet:function (both nodes; stand-in kind slot 'import' == kind 'import'). Zero ids anywhere end in :0-0:file:file."  # d714
